Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Studii de piață
About Us: 
 Prime Insights is a Sweden-based technology company reaching millions of diverse users through our proprietary Market Research Panel. Our innovative technology supports our international community and gives our members a world-class survey taking experience. Our mission is to match our authentic members to our client's market research surveys which allows our clients to achieve meaningful insights from the sample we deliver via online quantitative research. Members are rewarded with meaningful incentives, ensuring their sincere participation.
 Your Role: 
 As a Full Stack Developer, you will be instrumental in the design, development, and maintenance of our projects. Your primary responsibility will be to ensure the efficiency, scalability, and reliability of our applications, utilizing your expertise in JavaScript, PHP, SQL, and RESTful APIs. You will be working on a B2B platform with the opportunity to take a lead on that project. Your responsibilities will include building UI pages, components and APIs. Integrating external services and apis.
 Your Skills: 
2+ years of hands-on experience in PHP and JavaScript (or modern JS frameworks), including building RESTful API
Proficiency in SQL and a proven track record of efficiently handling large database
Familiarity with Docker and Git for seamless development and deployment processes
Strong understanding of data structures, and a keen eye for optimization
Ability to delve deep into existing systems to identify areas for improvement and implement solution
Proven capability to independently solve problems and drive projects forward
A curious mindset, always eager to learn and explore new technologies
Excellent communication skills in English, both written and verbal.
 Nice to Have: 
Experience building big UI forms with rendering optimization;
In-depth knowledge of backend PHP frameworks (e.g., Laravel or similar), maximizing their capabilities;
Experience with modern frontend frameworks (e.g., Vue.js, React, or Angular);
Familiarity with event bus and queues for asynchronous processes;
Exposure to additional development languages, broadening your skills;
Understanding of Cloud Infrastructure technologies, such as Kubernetes (K8S);
Experience with NoSQL databases like MongoDB or KeyDB/Redis;
Comfortable with Continuous Integration/Continuous Deployment (CI/CD) processes;
 Our Offer: 
Competitive salary commensurate with your experience and expertise;
Regular salary reviews to ensure your compensation reflects your contributions;
Collaborate with an international team on diverse and engaging projects;
Enjoy a safe and stable work environment with ample opportunities for growth and development;
AI enablement budget to support innovation and efficient.
 ❗Important: We are not considering freelancers or engineers working on multiple projects simultaneously. This is a full-time position for a dedicated professional who’s ready to fully commit to a single product ecosystem and contribute meaningfully to its long-term success.
